      "content": "No, do not put butter or vaseline on a burn, as it can worsen the injury. Remove any clothing or jewelry near the burn and gently rinse the affected area with cool, running water for 10-15 minutes. Then, cover it with a clean, non-stick bandage or cloth and seek medical attention immediately. Do not attempt to pop any blisters, as this can lead to infection.",
